    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Researchers, educationalists and policy makers meet to discuss early childhood development in a three-day long workshop In Dar es Salaam beginning today. \"Early Childhood Development in Uncertain Times: From Awareness and Evidence to Commitment and Action\" is the theme of the Second International Conference on Early Childhood Development- an initiative by the Aga Khan University's Institute for Human Development (IHD), in partnership with The Conrad N. Hilton Foundation and The Aga Khan Foundation.",
